        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Reactive Slime"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: A creature within the babau's reach successfully hits the babau with a Strike\n\nThe babau excretes a gout of acidic, bloodlike slime against the attacker and its weapon. The attacker must attempt a DC 24 Reflex save.\n\nCritical Success: The attacker is unaffected.\nSuccess: The attacker takes 1d6 acid damage.\nFailure: The attacker takes 2d6 acid damage.\nCritical Failure: As failure, except the weapon used to Strike the babau becomes broken, unless the weapon is made of a material that is immune to acid."
            },
